title: "TELEMACHUS: Certified information acquisition and escalation in AI agents"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "George David"
    family-names: "Tsitlauri"
    affiliation: "Department of Informatics and Telecommunications, University of Thessaly, Lamia, Greece"
  - given-names: "Georgios"
