date-released: 2026-10-01
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gdtsitlauri/telemachus"
abstract: >-
  A framework and experiments for deciding when an AI agent should look, think, ask or act, with
  Learn-then-Test risk guarantees across robot navigation, a multi-agent team, a language agent and a
  vision-language model, plus a finite-horizon guarantee for online risk control with a stochastic fallback.
keywords: [AI agents, risk control, Learn-then-Test, escalation, distribution shift]
